{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01AZbANTxcMAJFZtm4hEPLph","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Daho41ZGnqTCiFQga5MW7d","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/stories/06-turn-end-boundary-advance.md","old_string":"- **AC-5.3**: The peek-ahead stop: a turn is evicted only if the zone's sum after evicting it remains ≥ target. The advance lands in [target, target + one turn). The newest closed turn is never evicted.","new_string":"- **AC-5.3**: The peek-ahead stop: a turn is evicted only if the zone's sum after evicting it remains ≥ target. The advance lands in [target, target + one turn) only when that landing is achievable without violating newest-closed-turn protection or the structural protection of trailing turnless singleton groups positioned after the newest closed turn; when those protections would otherwise have to be broken to reach the window, they take precedence and the zone lawfully stays above [target, target + one turn). The newest closed turn is never evicted."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6607,"cache_read_input_tokens":34021,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6607},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c6fd1fc9-717e-4718-8050-43c47347ff45","uuid":"18b8b822-5373-4d36-a5e9-b0fc697e7071","request_id":"req_011CbzHy27rBfD7Eie4TW3m7"}
